── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────── E0100_c_if_without_braces.lt:2:14  [E0100]

The body of `if` is a block, in braces:

  2 │   if n > 100 return 100
    │              ^^^^^^

Braces always mark a branch or a loop's body, so the condition needs no
parentheses.

To fix it, write the body in braces:

  2 │   if n > 100 { return 100 }
    │              ++          ++
